{{ModBox}}

'''Galvanized Aptitude''' is the [[Galvanized Mods|Galvanized]] variant of {{M|Rifle Aptitude}}, increasing [[status chance]]. Kills grant a buff that increases direct hit damage (not area-of-effect) for each [[Status Effect|status type]] affecting the target for 20 seconds and stacks up to 2 times.

