== Trivia ==

* This mod (along with {{M|Galvanized Savvy}} and {{M|Galvanized Shot}}) is sometimes referred to as "'''<u>Gun</u>'''dition Overload" or "Gun CO" by the community. It is a play on {{M|Condition Overload}}, a mod for melee weapons with similar functionality.

